Description: Implements bridge regression with linear coefficient restrictions
    using the local quadratic approximation described by Yuzbasi, Arashi and
    Akdeniz (2021) <doi:10.1007/s00500-021-05763-9>. Provides coefficient paths,
    cross-validation, prediction and coefficient extraction for restricted and
    unrestricted linear models.
